## 🚀 Execution & Usage Guide

Follow these steps directly within your Linux environment to run the file migration utility.

### Step 1: Filter and Verify Targets
Navigate to your scripts folder and run the Bash discovery script. This will create a sanitized `oldFiles.txt` tracking list containing only valid, verified file references.

```bash
cd ~/scripts
chmod +x findJane.sh
./findJane.sh
```

